        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate controlling overtrading with session and setup limits. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示通过时段与形态限制控制过度交易。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
